    <h1>Only you can press submit. Build the intake before April 2027.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Submissions go through HM Land Registry’s new digital service and must be made by an individually regulated conveyancer: a solicitor, licensed conveyancer or legal executive personally authorised for land registration work. Not a supervised fee-earner, not the client.</p>
